  "editorialHtmlEn": "<p>Ordering mirrors how NVIDIA, TSMC, Broadcom, etc. sit in public market-cap tables — not a buy list.</p><p>Unlike the portal page (mass-market web traffic), this row tracks semis and hyperscalers you see in capex / GPU supply headlines — still <strong>not</strong> investment advice; check filings and your own risk tolerance.</p><p>Last reviewed: <strong>2026-05-19</strong>. Links favor investor-relations and official newsrooms over rumor blogs.</p><p>When a GPU shortage story breaks, I open IR pages from here — not YouTube “stock guru” channels.</p>",
  "editorialHtmlZh": "<p>顺序大致按公开市场上的市值梯队来排（英伟达、台积电、博通等），不是荐股清单。</p><p>与 portal 页的「大众网站流量」不同，这里偏半导体与平台型公司在算力/资本开支叙事里的位置；同样<strong>不构成</strong>投资建议，交易前请阅读各公司披露文件并自行评估风险。</p><p>最近核对：<strong>2026-05-19</strong>。链接优先投资者关系页与官方新闻稿，而非传闻聚合站。</p><p>GPU 紧缺新闻出来时，我会从这里进 IR/新闻稿，而不是点开短视频荐股号。</p>",
  "rankTitleEn": "Global top 10 (market cap)",
  "rankTitleZh": "全球前十（市值梯队）",
  "rankLeadEn": "Chip and platform names that usually sit near the top of public market-cap screens — order is a snapshot, not a trading signal.",
